 of 2026. Markets outside agriculture remained robust overall. At Kuhn Group, a recent improvement in the willingness to invest was noticeable in the USA; however, the economic situation for farmers remained strained, particularly in Europe, due to extreme drought and rising operating costs. Kuhn Group therefore recorded a lower order intake compared with the prior-year period. At Group level, this decline was offset by the positive development in other divisions, particularly noteworthy were the order intakes at Bucher Hydraulics and Bucher Municipal. Group sales also remained stable on a comparable basis. However, capacity utilisation remained very low at various production sites, particularly at Kuhn Group in Brazil and at Bucher Emhart Glass. Bucher Industries consistently continued the cost-saving measures it had initiated, further adapted its cost structures to the market environment and simplified the structures at Bucher Specials. The solid balance sheet and high liquidity as well as the broad market coverage strengthen the Group’s resilience in this challenging market environment and provide a reliable foundation for its future development."]},{"type":"p","children":["Business performance in the divisions"]},{"type":"p","children":["Kuhn Group"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["  "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["January – Septem­ber "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":3},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Change "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Full year "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"