ildren":["2) Adjusted for currency and acquisition effects"]},{"type":"p","children":["Signs of market recovery emerging Bucher Emhart Glass’s customers remained cautious about investments during the first nine months of 2026. However, the first signs of a recovery became apparent during the reporting period. Order intake was on a par with the prior-year period, with a positive trend evident in the service and spare parts business. Sales fell significantly due to the low order intake in previous periods and a lack of new major projects. Some sales markets in Eastern Europe, Türkiye and India performed well. Owing to the very low capacity utilisation at the production sites, cost-saving measures were implemented, and production planning was consistently adjusted to reflect the low order book."]},{"type":"p","children":["Outlook for 2026 On a comparable basis, Bucher Emhart Glass expects significantly lower sales compared with the prior year. The operating profit margin is expected to be significantly lower than in 2025."]},{"type":"p","children":["Bucher Specials"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["  "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["January – Septem­ber "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":3},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Change "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Full year "]}]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"t